ke. |\n| `-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release` | Compile with **optimizations** (`-O3`-level) and no debug symbols. |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr` | Where `make install` will place files (system root). |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib` | Put libraries in `lib/` (not `lib64/`, for Arch's layout). |\n| `-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx` | Use Intel's **C compiler** ("}